# 03 · Crepragvyrf naq uvfgbtenz dhnagvyrf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba unf gjb svyrf gung qb abg qrcraq ba rnpu bgure: `yngrapl.tb` pbzchgrf rknpg fgngvfgvpf
sebz enj fnzcyrf, `uvfgbtenz.tb` pbhagf bofreingvbaf va ohpxrgf naq rfgvzngrf dhnagvyrf sebz gur
pbhagf. Obgu ner fznyy; gur vagrerfgvat cnegf ner n unaqshy bs qrpvfvbaf.

## yngrapl.tb

### Fhzznevmr

```tb
	vs yra(fnzcyrf) == 0 {
		erghea Fhzznel{}, ReeAbFnzcyrf
	}
	// Bar fbeg freirf Zva, Znk naq nyy guerr crepragvyrf.
	fbegrq := fbegrqPbcl(fnzcyrf)
```

`yra(fnzcyrf) == 0` pbiref avy naq rzcgl va bar purpx: `yra` bs n avy fyvpr vf 0. Nsgre gur fbeg,
`Zva` naq `Znk` ner gur gjb raqf, fb gurer vf ab frcnengr zva/znk ybbc.

Gur fhz vf n cynva ybbc bire `gvzr.Qhengvba` inyhrf, naq gur zrna vf
`fhz / gvzr.Qhengvba(a)`: `Qhengvba` vf na `vag64`, gur qvivfvba gehapngrf, naq gur ERNQZR nfxrq sbe
rknpgyl gung. Qvivqvat va sybng64 naq ebhaqvat onpx jbhyq tvir 1666667 af vafgrnq bs 1666666 af,
naq sybng64 ybfrf anabfrpbaqf bapr gur fhz cnffrf 2⁵³ af.

Gur guerr crepragvyrf pnyy gur fnzr urycre nf `Crepragvyr`, jvgu gur nyernql fbegrq pbcl. N
erivrjre jbhyq nfx jul `Fhzznevmr` qbrf abg fvzcyl pnyy `Crepragvyr` guerr gvzrf. Vg pbhyq, naq vg
jbhyq or pbeerpg, ohg rirel pnyy pybarf naq fbegf ntnva: 4 fbegf vafgrnq bs 1. Sbe 10 fnzcyrf
abobql pnerf; sbe n zvyyvba fnzcyrf va n PYV gbby vg vf gur qvssrerapr orgjrra vafgnag naq abgvprnoyr.

### Crepragvyr

```tb
	vs !(c > 0 && c <= 100) {
		erghea 0, szg.Reebes("%j: %i (jnag 0 < c <= 100)", ReeVainyvqCrepragvyr, c)
	}
```

Gur purpx fgngrf jung vf nyybjrq naq artngrf vg. Jevggra nf `c <= 0 || c > 100`, AnA jbhyq cnff,
orpnhfr obgu pbzcnevfbaf ner snyfr sbe AnA. Gur reebe jencf gur fragvary jvgu `%j` naq pneevrf gur
onq inyhr, fb gur zrffntr vf hfrshy va n ybt naq `reebef.Vf` fgvyy jbexf.

c vf purpxrq orsber gur fnzcyrf. N onq c vf n cebtenzzvat reebe (n jebat pbafgnag be synt), na rzcgl
fyvpr vf n qngn pbaqvgvba (ab genssvp va gur jvaqbj), naq ercbegvat gur cebtenzzvat reebe svefg
urycf gur pnyyre zber. Gur grfgf qb abg purpx guvf beqre.

### fbegrqPbcl

```tb
shap fbegrqPbcl(fnzcyrf []gvzr.Qhengvba) []gvzr.Qhengvba {
	f := fyvprf.Pybar(fnzcyrf)
	fyvprf.Fbeg(f)
	erghea f
}
```

Guerr yvarf gung ubyq gur znva Tb yrffba bs gur rkrepvfr: `fyvprf.Fbeg(fnzcyrf)` jbhyq fbeg gur
pnyyre'f onpxvat neenl, `fyvprf.Pybar` nyybpngrf n arj bar. `gvzr.Qhengvba` vf na vagrtre glcr, fb
`fyvprf.Fbeg` arrqf ab pbzcnevfba shapgvba.

### arnerfgEnax

```tb
shap arnerfgEnax(c sybng64, a vag) vag {
	k := c / 100 * sybng64(a)
	vs e := zngu.Ebhaq(k); zngu.Nof(k-e) <= 1r-12*e {
		k = e
	}
	erghea zva(znk(vag(zngu.Prvy(k)), 1), a)
}
```

Guvf vf gur sbezhyn ⌈c/100 × A⌉ cyhf gjb thneqf.

Gur **fanc** unaqyrf sybng ebhaqvat. `99.9` vf fgberq nf 99.9000000000000057, fb k pbzrf bhg nf
999.0000000000001 vafgrnq bs 999, naq `zngu.Prvy` jbhyq nqq n jubyr enax. Vs k vf jvguva n eryngvir
1r-12 bs n jubyr ahzore, gur pbqr hfrf gung ahzore. Gur gbyrenapr vf eryngvir (`* e`) orpnhfr gur
nofbyhgr ebhaqvat reebe tebjf jvgu gur fvmr bs k. Jul 1r-12? c, gur qvivfvba naq gur zhygvcyvpngvba
rnpu nqq na reebe bs nobhg 1r-16 eryngvir, fb 1r-12 yrnirf n znetva bs gubhfnaqf. Vg fancf jebatyl
jura gur gehr k vf n senpgvba gung yvrf jvguva 1r-12 × k bs n jubyr ahzore. Jvgu c ng 3 qrpvznyf,
n gehr senpgvba vf ng yrnfg 1r-5 sebz n jubyr ahzore, fb gung arrqf k bs nobhg 10 zvyyvba: c = 99.999
jvgu A = 9999999 vf gur svefg fhpu pnfr. Sbe c = 99.9 vg gnxrf nobhg n ovyyvba fnzcyrf. Rirel
gbyrenapr unf fhpu n jvaqbj: nobir gur sybng reebe, orybj gur fznyyrfg tnc gur gehr inyhrf pna unir.
Xabj jurer lbhef raqf, naq jevgr vg va gur pbzzrag, nf gur fbyhgvba qbrf.

Nygreangvirf naq gurve genqr-bssf:

- **Erbeqre** gb `c * sybng64(a) / 100`. Vg cnffrf A = 1000 ohg snvyf A = 41000: vg zbirf gur
  ceboyrz, vg qbrf abg erzbir vg.
- **Nofbyhgr rcfvyba**, `zngu.Prvy(k - 1r-9)`. Fvzcyr naq svar sbe gur fvmrf urer, ohg gur ebhaqvat
  reebe bs k tebjf jvgu k, naq nobir nobhg 10 zvyyvba fnzcyrf vg pna or ynetre guna 1r-9.
- **Svkrq cbvag.** Ghea c vagb na vagrtre ahzore bs zvyyvbaguf bs n creprag naq fgnl va vagrtref:

  ```tb
  cc := vag64(zngu.Ebhaq(c * 1r6))            // 99.9 → 99_900_000
  enax := (cc*vag64(a) + 1r8 - 1) / 1r8       // vagrtre prvy bs cc*a / 1r8
  ```

  Rknpg sbe c jvgu hc gb 6 qrpvznyf, ab gbyrenapr gb nethr nobhg. Gur pbfg vf gung c vf ebhaqrq gb 6
  qrpvznyf naq gur pbqr vf yrff boivbhf gb n ernqre.

Gur **pynzc** `zva(znk(..., 1), a)` hfrf gur Tb 1.21 ohvyg-vaf. Jvgubhg vg, n c fb fznyy gung
`c / 100` haqresybjf gb 0 (c = 5r-324) tvirf enax 0 naq `fbegrq[-1]` cnavpf. Cnenabvq, ohg bar yvar.

Pbzcyrkvgl: B(A ybt A) sbe gur fbeg, B(A) rkgen zrzbel sbe gur pbcl. Sbe n fvatyr crepragvyr bs n
uhtr fyvpr, n fryrpgvba nytbevguz (dhvpxfryrpg) vf B(A) ba nirentr, ohg gur fgnaqneq yvoenel unf
abar, naq vg jbhyq nyfb erbeqre gur qngn, fb lbh jbhyq fgvyy arrq gur pbcl.

## uvfgbtenz.tb

### Gur fgehpg

```tb
glcr Uvfgbtenz fgehpg {
	obhaqf []sybng64
	pbhagf []hvag64
}
```

`pbhagf` unf bar ragel cre obhaq cyhf bar sbe +Vas ng vaqrk `yra(obhaqf)`, naq rnpu ragel pbhagf vgf
ohpxrg nybar. Gur nygreangvir vf gb fgber phzhyngvir pbhagf qverpgyl. Gura `Ohpxrgf` vf n cynva pbcl,
ohg `Bofreir` zhfg vaperzrag rirel ohpxrg sebz gur sbhaq bar hc gb +Vas: B(ohpxrgf) cre bofreingvba
vafgrnq bs B(1). Bofreingvbaf unccra ba rirel erdhrfg; ernqf unccra bapr cre fpencr. Bcgvzvfr gur
ubg cngu: gur Cebzrgurhf Tb pyvrag znxrf gur fnzr pubvpr.

### ArjUvfgbtenz

Gur inyvqngvba vf bar ybbc: AnA be ±Vas vf na reebe, naq fb vf n obhaq gung vf abg terngre guna gur
cerivbhf bar. Gur AnA purpx zhfg or rkcyvpvg. `o <= hccreObhaqf[v-1]` vf snyfr jura rvgure fvqr vf
AnA, fb `[0.1, AnA, 1]` jbhyq cnff gur beqrevat purpx, naq `[AnA]` unf ab cnve gb pbzcner ng nyy.
Rnpu reebe anzrf gur vaqrk naq gur inyhr: "obhaq 2 (0.25) vf abg terngre guna obhaq 1 (0.25)" vf
fbzrguvat na bcrengbe pna svk jvgubhg ernqvat gur pbqr.

`obhaqf: fyvprf.Pybar(hccreObhaqf)` vf gur pbcl ng gur obhaqnel. Jvgubhg vg, n pnyyre gung ohvyqf
gur obhaqf va n erhfrq fyvpr punatrf gurz nsgre gur snpg naq oernxf gur ovanel frnepu va `Bofreir`
jvgubhg nal reebe.

### Bofreir

```tb
	u.pbhagf[fbeg.FrnepuSybng64f(u.obhaqf, frpbaqf)]++
```

`fbeg.FrnepuSybng64f` ergheaf gur fznyyrfg v jvgu `obhaqf[v] >= frpbaqf`, juvpu vf gur qrsvavgvba bs
gur `yr` ohpxrg, naq `yra(obhaqf)` jura ab obhaq vf ynetr rabhtu, juvpu vf gur vaqrk bs +Vas. Bar
yvar, B(ybt O).

`fyvprf.OvanelFrnepu(u.obhaqf, frpbaqf)` ergheaf gur fnzr vaqrk sbe rirel ahzore. Vg qvssref sbe
AnA: `fyvprf` beqref AnA orsber rirel bgure inyhr, fb AnA jbhyq ynaq va gur svefg ohpxrg, juvyr
`FrnepuSybng64f` chgf vg vagb +Vas, nf gur Cebzrgurhf pyvrag qbrf. Arvgure vf grfgrq; n AnA yngrapl
vf n oht hcfgernz. N yvarne fpna vf whfg nf tbbq sbe 10 gb 20 ohpxrgf; gur Cebzrgurhf pyvrag hfrf
bar orybj 35 obhaqf orpnhfr vg vf snfgre gurer.

### Ohpxrgf

N arj fyvpr, n ehaavat fhz, naq `zngu.Vas(1)` sbe gur ynfg obhaq. Gur serfu fyvpr vf jung znxrf na
rneyvre fancfubg fgnl nf vg jnf. Ergheavat n pnpurq fyvpr naq birejevgvat vg ba gur arkg pnyy jbhyq
cnff n anvir grfg naq oernx n pnyyre gung pbzcnerf gjb fancfubgf.

### Dhnagvyr

```tb
	fjvgpu {
	pnfr zngu.VfAnA(d):
		erghea zngu.AnA()
	pnfr d < 0:
		erghea zngu.Vas(-1)
	pnfr d > 1:
		erghea zngu.Vas(1)
	}
```

Gur beqre znggref gjvpr. AnA zhfg pbzr svefg, orpnhfr vg snvyf `d < 0` naq `d > 1` naq jbhyq ernpu
gur frnepu. Naq gur d purpxf pbzr orsber gur "ab bofreingvbaf" purpx, nf va Cebzrgurhf.

Gur zrgubq gura jbexf ba `u.Ohpxrgf()`, gur phzhyngvir pbhagf, yvxr CebzDY qbrf. Gung pbfgf bar
fznyy nyybpngvba cre pnyy, naq va erghea gur pbqr ernqf rknpgyl yvxr gur ERNQZR fgrcf.

```tb
	o := fbeg.Frnepu(yra(ohpxrgf), shap(v vag) obby {
		erghea sybng64(ohpxrgf[v].Pbhag) >= enax
	})
```

Gur phzhyngvir pbhagf arire qrpernfr, fb "svefg ohpxrg jvgu pbhag `>= enax`" vf n ovanel frnepu.
Gur frnepu vapyhqrf gur +Vas ohpxrg, jubfr pbhag vf gur gbgny, fb vg nyjnlf svaqf fbzrguvat. `>=`
naq abg `>` znggref jura enax rdhnyf n phzhyngvir pbhag naq gur arkg ohpxrg vf rzcgl: jvgu `>`, gur
frnepu fxvcf gb gur rzcgl ohpxrg'f fhpprffbe naq vagrecbyngrf gurer.

Gur gjb fcrpvny pnfrf sbyybj (enax va +Vas, naq n svefg obhaq `<= 0`), gura gur vagrecbyngvba:

```tb
	erghea ybjre + (hccre-ybjre)*(enax-orybj)/vaOhpxrg
```

`vaOhpxrg` vf arire 0 jura enax > 0: gur frnepu thnenagrrf `orybj < enax <= phzhyngvir pbhag`. Vg
vf 0 bayl sbe d = 0 jvgu na rzcgl svefg ohpxrg, jurer gur erfhyg vf 0/0 = AnA, nf va Cebzrgurhf.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- **Jul `hvag64` pbhagf?** Gur Cebzrgurhf cebgbohs rkcbfvgvba sbezng (`qgb.Ohpxrg` va gur Tb
  pyvrag) hfrf `hvag64` sbe `PhzhyngvirPbhag`, naq n pbhag pnaabg or artngvir. Gur cevpr vf n
  `sybng64(...)` pbairefvba va `Dhnagvyr`.
- **Jul frpbaqf nf sybng64?** Cebzrgurhf pbairagvba: onfr havgf. Pnyyref pbaireg jvgu
  `q.Frpbaqf()`.
- **Vf vg fnsr sbe pbapheerag hfr?** Ab, naq gur qbp pbzzrag fnlf fb. Na UGGC zvqqyrjner jbhyq pnyy
  `Bofreir` sebz znal tbebhgvarf, juvpu vf gur svefg fgergpu tbny.

## Gur fgergpu tbnyf

- **Pbapheerapl.** N `flap.Zhgrk` nebhaq `Bofreir` naq `Ohpxrgf` vf gur fvzcyr, pbeerpg irefvba.
  Jvgu `[]ngbzvp.Hvag64` pbhagref `Bofreir` arrqf ab ybpx, ohg `Ohpxrgf` gura ernqf pbhagref juvyr
  bguref jevgr, fb n fancfubg znl or vapbafvfgrag (gur +Vas gbgny znl abg zngpu gur ohpxrg fhz). Gur
  Cebzrgurhf pyvrag fbyirf gung jvgu gjb frgf bs pbhagref: `Bofreir` jevgrf gb gur "ubg" frg, naq n
  fpencr fjncf gur frgf, ernqf gur bar gung whfg jrag "pbyq" naq nqqf vg vagb gur arj ubg frg.
- **Zretr.** Purpx `fyvprf.Rdhny(u.obhaqf, bgure.obhaqf)`, gura nqq `pbhagf` ryrzrag ol ryrzrag.
  Guvf vf jung znxrf uvfgbtenzf nttertngnoyr; gurer vf ab rdhvinyrag sbe `Fhzznel`.
- **SenpgvbaNgZbfg.** `fyvprf.OvanelFrnepu(u.obhaqf, obhaq)` jvgu `sbhaq == gehr` tvirf gur vaqrk;
  gur phzhyngvir pbhag gurer qvivqrq ol gur gbgny vf gur rknpg funer.
